{"data":[{"author_id":"55964567","created_at":"2026-10-27T00:52:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114882903738122427"],"id":"2114882903738122427","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":104305,"like_count":42,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":79,"retweet_count":2},"text":"王岐山：网上都在传，你要把我关到秦城。习近平： https://t.co/8CfkzAWAlz https://t.co/Eld32cxDmi","url":"https://x.com/wuzuolai/status/2114882903738122427"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-27T00:39:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114879656956698737"],"id":"2114879656956698737","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":33,"impression_count":6773,"like_count":78,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":10},"text":"什么叫“三分钟热度”的价值？就是不要因为无法长期坚持，就否定短暂行动的意义。人的精力、情绪和意志力本就存在周期性波动，持续投入不等于始终保持高强度，偶尔间断也不意味着前功尽弃。真正重要的不是每次投入多少，而是每次行动能否留下经验、反馈和积累，让下一次开始不必从零起步。成长并不要求一","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2114879656956698737"},{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-27T00:33:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114878198148465066"],"id":"2114878198148465066","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":72673,"like_count":108,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":3},"text":"人类完蛋了。","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2114878198148465066"},{"author_id":"1531801543","created_at":"2026-10-27T00:31:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114877653664821560"],"id":"2114877653664821560","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3783,"like_count":27,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":4},"text":"【安徽三條高鐵同日開始試運行】據中國鐵路上海局集團有限公司和安徽省投資集團消息，10月26日，安徽省內淮蚌、淮阜、巢馬三條高鐵同日開始試運行，三條新線開通運營進入倒計時。三條高鐵試運行將持續一個月左右，預計2026年年底前具備開通運營條件。 https://t.co/XjHrP8U7XC","url":"https://x.com/PDChinese/status/2114877653664821560"},{"author_id":"3319804777","created_at":"2026-10-27T00:27:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114876521634725906"],"id":"2114876521634725906","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1811,"like_count":14,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":17},"text":"内蒙古玉泉区：平湖藏秋 疏木含章\n深秋时节，内蒙古呼和浩特市玉泉区大黑河郊野公园秋色斑斓。千岛湖碧波轻漾，岸边林木层层染秋，广阔的草甸泛起金黄，骏马悠然踱步其间。湖水映着秋林，金色原野向远方铺展，勾勒出塞外秋日辽阔而宁静的景致。 https://t.co/txEz3JKZgG","url":"https://x.com/XinhuaChinese/status/2114876521634725906"},{"author_id":"1938963008","created_at":"2026-10-27T00:26:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114876259683766310"],"id":"2114876259683766310","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":7646,"like_count":68,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":4},"text":"看来被视为“中国经济衰落”象征的马驹桥离被取缔不远了...... https://t.co/ZWuQYy62wJ","url":"https://x.com/HotmailfromSH/status/2114876259683766310"},{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-27T00:22:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114875193508208957","2114875258423624164"],"id":"2114875258423624164","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":65109,"like_count":158,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":41,"retweet_count":6},"text":"联合国到底哪天开安理会，\n\n安理会五常必须联合逼迫OpenAI撤回The ETH is false的paper，并且删除整个lean4 project，并且让大慈树王烧毁世界树，抹去全人类对于The ETH is false这个证伪的全部记忆，最后在联合国宪章添加一条，禁止触碰任何3 SAT和ETH和P=NP的尝试。\n\n这是拯救人类的唯一办法。","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2114875258423624164"},{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-27T00:21:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114875193508208957","2114875258423624164"],"id":"2114875193508208957","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":977,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"联合国到底哪天开安理会，\n\n安理会五常必须联合逼迫OpenAI撤回The ETH is false的paper，并且删除整个lean4 project，并且让大慈树王烧毁世界树，抹去全人类对于The ETH is false这个证伪的全部记忆，\n\n最后在联合国宪章添加一条，禁止触碰任何3 SAT和ETH和P=NP的尝试。\n\n这是拯救人类的唯一办法。","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2114875193508208957"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-27T00:19:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114874663339979129"],"id":"2114874663339979129","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":36,"impression_cou